{
 "about": "Customizations of a top-level set uploaded DRAFT or ARCHIVED, which round 30 found the customization does not see: a disable of a set uploaded INACTIVE was refused (r30pairs-none-001), and a replace of an ARCHIVED or a DRAFT set added a set beside it (r30pairs-one-002, r30open-replace-draft-to-active). First, a disable of a DRAFT and of an ARCHIVED set: refused (400) if the customization does not see them, accepted (200) if it refuses only to disable a set that is INACTIVE already. Second, a PROJECT replace of an ARCHIVED set, then a CUSTOMER path into the same id that adds a policy: accepted, and read after true, if the path finds the set the replace added; refused if it finds the ARCHIVED set first. Each case reads before and after; read of a set out of service is false.",
